loses GH-25043","tree":{"sha":"adf8cf94b2b77697697adbf0c24a1ecef89dcab6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/git/trees/adf8cf94b2b77697697adbf0c24a1ecef89dcab6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/git/commits/896f76d2c72e4aa215dd55d40aef2be55149f376","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgs1E7nOvQUQluu4y9QQczOaAXHM\nh7npke1lM85AyRfi4AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQO7+VR+qC955AkA26lUhDcDsiU2WZnPyVOgA7DkF8wB9zPiscJyCcLu7J8App/uoSh\nxJdE3eyVhfipn/pmuKrQc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree adf8cf94b2b77697697adbf0c24a1ecef89dcab6\nparent ce899c8c681b77147b7daa5b2729cdbfda194027\nauthor Jorg Sowa <jorg.sowa@gmail.com> 1793458787 +0100\ncommitter Jorg Sowa <jorg.sowa@gmail.com> 1793458787 +0100\n\nFix preloaded functions not JIT-compiled again after OPcache restart\n\nzend_jit_restart_hot_counters() restored the hot counters but kept\nZEND_FUNC_JITED, so zend_jit_hot_func() never compiled the function again.\nWith opcache.jit_hot_func=1 this loops forever.\n\nCloses GH-25043\n","verified_at":"2026-10-31T15:16:06Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/commits/896f76d2c72e4aa215dd55d40aef2be55149f376","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/commit/896f76d2c72e4aa215dd55d40aef2be55149f376","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/commits/896f76d2c72e4aa215dd55d40aef2be55149f376/comments","author":{"login":"jorgsowa","id":74921107,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0OTIxMTA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74921107?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jorgsowa","html_url":"https://github.com/jorgsowa","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jorgsowa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jorgsowa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jorgsowa/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api