JkMWEyYTAxNDViZTg5MTI2MzQzMmYzNGQyMzdjNjA5ZTM","commit":{"author":{"name":"Ilia Alshanetsky","email":"ilia@ilia.ws","date":"2026-09-24T23:10:44Z"},"committer":{"name":"Ilia Alshanetsky","email":"ilia@ilia.ws","date":"2026-10-31T22:02:50Z"},"message":"ext/json: Stop encoding after a key fails to encode\n\nA failure to escape an array or object key was ignored unless\nJSON_PARTIAL_OUTPUT_ON_ERROR was set, so encoding went on: later values\nstill ran user code such as jsonSerialize(), and a later error replaced\nthe one that was reported, e.g. a NAN value after an invalid UTF-8 key\nreported \"Inf and NaN cannot be JSON encoded\". Both key sites, the\ndeclared-property loop and the property table loop, now return FAILURE\nthe same way a failed value does.\n\nCloses GH-24123","tree":{"sha":"cc48d27d83f575983069aef01be474448b0f7a74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/git/trees/cc48d27d83f575983069aef01be474448b0f7a74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/git/commits/de6ffebd1a2a0145be891263432f34d237c609e3","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgdYhKZ4kd7+tlpRbDZ0aP7UxDG4\ndIRutl3Ksx2/yts4sAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQFkj9wFzYFLklJbcOOc9OUdJBPwdwCXVWknFCPvOW2mSOm+lT6e18AFSEaJ1bT1IMu\nCULR1bLS56u5bm5THV5wU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree cc48d27d83f575983069aef01be474448b0f7a74\nparent 084e7a07b70e4597853ab9f61a8632bdd152ea49\nauthor Ilia Alshanetsky <ilia@ilia.ws> 1790291444 -0400\ncommitter Ilia Alshanetsky <ilia@ilia.ws> 1793484170 -0400\n\next/json: Stop encoding after a key fails to encode\n\nA failure to escape an array or object key was ignored unless\nJSON_PARTIAL_OUTPUT_ON_ERROR was set, so encoding went on: later values\nstill ran user code such as jsonSerialize(), and a later error replaced\nthe one that was reported, e.g. a NAN value after an invalid UTF-8 key\nreported \"Inf and NaN cannot be JSON encoded\". Both key sites, the\ndeclared-property loop and the property table loop, now return FAILURE\nthe same way a failed value does.\n\nCloses GH-24123\n","verified_at":"2026-10-31T22:04:59Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/commits/de6ffebd1a2a0145be891263432f34d237c609e3","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/commit/de6ffebd1a2a0145be891263432f34d237c609e3","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/commits/de6ffebd1a2a0145be891263432f34d237c609e3/comments","author":{"login":"iliaal","id":158724,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODcyNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158724?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iliaal","html_url":"https://github.com/iliaal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iliaal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iliaal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iliaal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iliaal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iliaal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iliaal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iliaal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iliaal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iliaal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"iliaal","id":158724,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODcyNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158724?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iliaal","html_url":"https://github.com/iliaal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iliaal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iliaal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iliaal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iliaal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.g