owing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielEScherzer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielEScherzer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielEScherzer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielEScherzer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielEScherzer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielEScherzer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielEScherzer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielEScherzer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"b7f1b60a99e7ebea261d8ca755d5dad031eef45c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/commits/b7f1b60a99e7ebea261d8ca755d5dad031eef45c","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/commit/b7f1b60a99e7ebea261d8ca755d5dad031eef45c"}]},{"sha":"61edcf9be7d16a325ff94d714f1208bcb00e90a4","node_id":"C_kwDOAB0LotoAKDYxZWRjZjliZTdkMTZhMzI1ZmY5NGQ3MTRmMTIwOGJjYjAwZTkwYTQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"lazerg","email":"lazerg2@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-01T06:21:30Z"},"committer":{"name":"Weilin Du","email":"weilindu@php.net","date":"2026-11-01T06:21:30Z"},"message":"Fix GH-25089: Heap buffer over-read via crafted alias size in zip-based phar (#25099)\n\nphar_parse_zipfile() set the alias length from the size claimed in the ZIP\nheaders before reading the alias, but the buffer only holds what was\nactually decompressed. A smaller payload made phar_validate_alias() and\nPhar::getAlias() read past the buffer.\n\nSet the alias length after reading the alias, using the actual number of\nbytes read.\n\nFixes #25089.\n\nCloses #25099","tree":{"sha":"0083f317ce8fc13a0cdf84bb5861822acce30f8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/git/trees/0083f317ce8fc13a0cdf84bb5861822acce30f8f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/git/commits/61edcf9be7d16a325ff94d714f1208bcb00e90a4","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEEaDXx4YiBo+JEKqlm6j2Y1d107h8FAmrm2mobFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMiwxAAoJEOo9mNXddO4fz4wQAIelMFbjeP1uT0JuUthy\nv2FF5xwVlj6RNIcUiTVYi0cH2sVfYEIim8FPWTkxQhTDTwJROxLod1wU9AdRUXYG\nlQfPTQ3CPtMXF8WZeNi9eahN3VWgNufP76DHqYlR88IHjeeEmNaEyfvudLIcuNES\nKKWb36T5Jh7q48K5YSvrryu5wcXjjfX1zhxhZlPITcyrVM97r71krn/nu1LiI5j6\nHCcyQLLUnIeNl/KMkGqc6tB6OTMzrTAi+IBA4+use+473Vu2FMyZe3N7d4CSx9Za\nkUwcIPe8lVxwY2J33MfWRvA9UWzLfEZRbUa1d2i9LMXB5yLGVTvAlXTG+R94x9ls\nK6qOntBj14UxWRlm0Yy5Uqkq9BOJ6VjiRCe8wm5dMOCNsF+vFb9U4RQss1bXUv/u\njUjDWo3S68TGX7pQRs6KZRF6oUkGONb68cP4BvBC9b+y54bYw+6hTc44O6Oz8WyF\njDZxNLXDmUFZMogkmxxXu4cykz6YqaFzmuKRaFdXuMYBjU2vk8TP+bpNg+0Psg6m\nCaeNa9vAB3wl9EIoqfzM7AkUdOZQd4NarC/NyBz/IsBEXXLy8ERD1rOef4uqAQ5s\nrY/WlyBHC8Vgi6bi520aUJSQNn5eM8T0jV5L0JEK2tBvqM71OrxQbbj/C1KOuQVy\nlv108k7s3sMij6VeIuww88AM\n=HjbR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 0083f317ce8fc13a0cdf84bb5861822acce30f8f\nparent 0c406ea1723d30fa64395a0e32db40f44a82036c\nauthor lazerg <lazerg2@gmail.com> 1793514090 +0800\ncommitter Weilin Du <weilindu@php.net> 1793514090 +0800\n\nFix GH-25089: Heap buffer over-read via crafted alias size in zip-based phar (#25099)\n\nphar_parse_zipfile() set the alias length from the size claimed in the ZIP\nheaders before reading the alias, but the buffer only holds what was\nactually decompressed. A smaller payload made phar_validate_alias() and\nPhar::getAlias() read past the buffer.\n\nSet the alias length after reading the alias, using the actual number of\nbytes read.\n\nFixes #25089.\n\nCloses #25099\n","verified_at":"2026-11-01T06:34:26Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/commits/61edcf9be7d16a325ff94d714f1208bcb00e90a4","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/commit/61edcf9be7d16a325ff94d714f1208bcb00e90a4","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/commits/61edcf9be7d16a325ff94d714f1208bcb00e90a4/comments","aut