LzZ5yoqLiZ35CP/roJLq133kgRKENGSgBckqQt8Oe6rq7lhaNUN\nWeSAeOcGLguqd1KFvz7Gm4+czS0Xbdy8L1xHCnIyoBViyaw3JlnyAYfyJXbntHVL\nMtLQv0BY3f/M5ngI6K0YWF5crp5oYYNmsSRU0oiI8jlXYn7E+ICRTL4m9BUr5JYC\noyvks9tiVYct7pT2oAAjt8z9qEW/MxV989J0x5JKoRnjexkdAYluqNFVuTDIDP6H\nP8BxjcdpkIk++hISpto12cVPrA+cHRKR6FJpaB+pnJzv5wRC6+4=\n=s9g6\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 9f85948b4d7d433aa127d26ef42b675954c813ca\nparent dc5acdb60e04f44c5ef38d32eabf1a90da243289\nauthor Peter Kokot <peterkokot@gmail.com> 1715619665 +0200\ncommitter Daniel Scherzer <daniel.e.scherzer+phpf@gmail.com> 1793657634 -0800\n\nUpdate PEAR failed download installation banner (#14216)\n\nThere was once install-su Makefile rule, now the install-pear can be\nused instead.\n\n(cherry picked from commit 9aee546919c3c593ea28b960a751cfa405b848b5)\n","verified_at":"2026-11-02T22:14:16Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/commits/0c56d7b0d8a5c344c0f9dc8853b131527b3b61b6","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/commit/0c56d7b0d8a5c344c0f9dc8853b131527b3b61b6","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/commits/0c56d7b0d8a5c344c0f9dc8853b131527b3b61b6/comments","author":{"login":"petk","id":1614009,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQwMDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1614009?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/petk","html_url":"https://github.com/petk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"DanielEScherzer","id":179652704,"node_id":"U_kgDOCrVIYA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179652704?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielEScherzer","html_url":"https://github.com/DanielEScherzer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielEScherzer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielEScherzer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielEScherzer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielEScherzer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielEScherzer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielEScherzer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielEScherzer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielEScherzer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielEScherzer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"dc5acdb60e04f44c5ef38d32eabf1a90da243289","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/commits/dc5acdb60e04f44c5ef38d32eabf1a90da243289","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/commit/dc5acdb60e04f44c5ef38d32eabf1a90da243289"}]},{"sha":"a082f1211aa417096372dbca4b8d207308563e18","node_id":"C_kwDOAB0LotoAKGEwODJmMTIxMWFhNDE3MDk2MzcyZGJjYTRiOGQyMDczMDg1NjNlMTg","commit":{"author":{"name":"Daniel Scherzer","email":"daniel.e.scherzer+phpf@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-09T18:39:18Z"},"committer":{"name":"Daniel Scherzer","email":"daniel.e.scherzer+phpf@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-02T22:13:58Z"},"message":"Persist the `pear/install-pear-nozlib.phar` file\n\nRather than downloading it as part of the `makedist` script, add the script to\nthe project's version control. The installation instructions are updated to\nindicate that the needed phar script is always present, and the only thing\nneeded is to become the superuser and run `make install-pear`.\n\nThe phar is currently marked as binary in the git attributes since it is not\nentirely text, it is committed as-is from the pear server and can be cleaned up\nin future commits.\n\nThis also fixes the installation process when previously the installation would\ntry to fallback to the `fetch.php` helper - it seems that the https stream\nwrapper is not included in PHP by default. Now that the phar is committed to\nversion control, the `fetch.php` helper script is no longer needed. After this\npatch, `./configure --with-pear --enable-xml` allows installing pear with\n`make` without additional manual actions.","tree":{"sha":"97b5cda2a96956116990e92ab43b5df40f24e70e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/git/trees/97b5cda2a96956116990e92ab43b5df40f24e70e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/git/commits/a082f1211aa417096372dbca4b8d207308563e18","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCAAdFiEE9UJ1xcAhN+9TYY3mv8WJ++8bqJwFAmrpCyYACgkQv8WJ++8b\nqJxKohAAivC35AUxK76UJP51jryY16PNlJDKssfdKVNP3Pa4AQKCGdM5p/s2881z\nO9QDHbeGk4+gx9kHo35bNXlh05z8klFNkh3R0D1VvML5TiGnoRURX7PzVOoeXlbE\n9QFNnan33aRFd6LjLB3aVCMW7NALwcKjlbbygkJqCe7p65B3niQD0oF2mtyaSxKl\nwKLPiRK3DQEBoxpea6ZXEXTZeNwEci/uMqDJzpIK4C1DWMXE1vzxd6992kdHQS8P\nmyYdsjZMcy0lU+Bzw1Gjc5nbcX/nZNcwVol+zpMCV4ZwGfF2diis9WQb83y6+I3g\n3rTguOljWSNnHqDI5whqmlsHkILeKVwUa3Dsm9hhcvv3+eoFLs/cXukFLl3QF8Ii\nL41L7zN237FpB9P0DT44QUkD4YqEQb/yXO0CmIbN7BvMpbFWK+8mlXieF3rKbZIZ\nalh0YylB4Gh4S+00PMgciZt/rOXHMtYDremoLCVCP+E9s4tlYIY3fgmjltxHqxPZ\nE3gcsjYiy/ZAjKVStlK6fts4lNV4NEwGGANk7RGi6NZY4F9+MVwoHJdmeZ5Ess3H\n8FQjpuILiZP6/teRHsirseefIOS9rCTRnpzDqvJIKQtwN6GrdbRPen2Laq1O5Jaz\n6dwJdjSMVuIoPtx1T9ZgHUZRGFdc9LpIp0ZEiLfrocEVmkVVMnc=\n=bXAQ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 97b5cda2a96956116990e92ab43b5df40f24e70e\nparent 0c56d7b0d8a5c344c0f9dc8853b131527b3b61b6\nauthor Daniel Scherzer <daniel.e.scherzer+phpf@gmail.com> 1788979158 -0700\ncommitter Daniel Scherzer <daniel.e.scherzer+phpf@gmail.com> 1793657638 -0800\n\nPersist the `pear/install-pear-nozlib.phar` file\n\nRather than downloading it as part of the `makedist` script, add the script to\nthe project's version control. The installation instructions are updated to\nindicate that the needed phar script is always present, and the only thing\nneeded is to become the superuser and run `make install-pear`.\n\nThe phar is currently marked as binary in the git attributes since it is not\nentirely text, it is committed as-is from the pear server and can be cleaned up\nin future commits.\n\nThis also fixes the installation process when previously the installation would\ntry to fallback to the `fetch.php` helper - it seems that the https stream\nwrapper is not included in PHP by default. Now that the phar is committed to\nversion control, the `fetch.php` helper script is no longer needed. After this\npatch, `./configure --with-pear --enable-xml` allows installing pear with\n`make` without additional manual actions.\n","verified_at":"2026-11-02T22:14:16Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/commits/a082f1211aa417096372dbca4b8d207308563e18","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/commit/a082f1211aa417096372dbca4b8d207308563e18","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/commits/a082f1211aa417096372dbca4b8d207308563e18/comments","author":{"login":"DanielEScherzer","id":179652704,"node_id":"U_kgDOCrVIYA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179652704?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielEScherzer","html_url":"https://github.com/DanielEScherzer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielEScherzer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielEScherzer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielEScherzer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielEScherzer/starred{/owner}