4bd866ee54c4a173191b89dcb743464d1fb4","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/commit/21e34bd866ee54c4a173191b89dcb743464d1fb4"}]},{"sha":"7774891f161faab183e6c83572a49e37cec8fed8","node_id":"C_kwDOAB0LotoAKDc3NzQ4OTFmMTYxZmFhYjE4M2U2YzgzNTcyYTQ5ZTM3Y2VjOGZlZDg","commit":{"author":{"name":"Alejandro Pacheco","email":"alepacheco99@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-15T02:45:51Z"},"committer":{"name":"ndossche","email":"7771979+ndossche@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-03T07:23:57Z"},"message":"Fix out-of-bounds reads parsing ftp:// wrapper server replies\n\nThe ftp:// wrapper parses replies in a 512-byte buffer at fixed offsets\nand sizes that are not tied to the line actually received:\n\n- get_ftp_result() returns the code of the last line read when the\n  stream ends, even if it is not a complete \"ddd \" status line, while\n  the callers parse the reply text from tmp_line + 4.\n- php_fopen_do_pasv() copies a fixed ip_size bytes from the dotted\n  address inside the buffer, reading past its end when the address is\n  near the end of the line, and silently truncating an over-long one.\n- The MDTM parsing in php_stream_ftp_url_stat() skips non-digits past\n  the terminating NUL, and its bound check allows sscanf() to start one\n  past the end of the buffer.\n\nOnly return a code from get_ftp_result() for a complete status line,\ncopy exactly the parsed address and reject one that does not fit, and\nstop the MDTM scan at the end of the line.\n\nCloses GH-24340.","tree":{"sha":"f51485b379bd9749f43bd4e432c3ac65c8f494ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/git/trees/f51485b379bd9749f43bd4e432c3ac65c8f494ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/git/commits/7774891f161faab183e6c83572a49e37cec8fed8","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQ9DfdEemyeZbWie5HRzUrZbcKICAUCaumMFQAKCRDRzUrZbcKI\nCG5mAQDB6vcSvHnqxbrs1MBMzHJ2PxTnQuQtAP3H9fWJcFMqmAEA1h43CDouPhFJ\nUMpZhs0oSQma8Ys2pYy7aYGPVZ6SfwA=\n=wUFg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree f51485b379bd9749f43bd4e432c3ac65c8f494ac\nparent fd996798308e5bfb8ed0b7a115924038f76b7687\nauthor Alejandro Pacheco <alepacheco99@gmail.com> 1792032351 +0200\ncommitter ndossche <7771979+ndossche@users.noreply.github.com> 1793690637 +0100\n\nFix out-of-bounds reads parsing ftp:// wrapper server replies\n\nThe ftp:// wrapper parses replies in a 512-byte buffer at fixed offsets\nand sizes that are not tied to the line actually received:\n\n- get_ftp_result() returns the code of the last line read when the\n  stream ends, even if it is not a complete \"ddd \" status line, while\n  the callers parse the reply text from tmp_line + 4.\n- php_fopen_do_pasv() copies a fixed ip_size bytes from the dotted\n  address inside the buffer, reading past its end when the address is\n  near the end of the line, and silently truncating an over-long one.\n- The MDTM parsing in php_stream_ftp_url_stat() skips non-digits past\n  the terminating NUL, and its bound check allows sscanf() to start one\n  past the end of the buffer.\n\nOnly return a code from get_ftp_result() for a complete status line,\ncopy exactly the parsed address and reject one that does not fit, and\nstop the MDTM scan at the end of the line.\n\nCloses GH-24340.\n","verified_at":"2026-11-03T07:25:02Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/commits/7774891f161faab183e6c83572a49e37cec8fed8","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/commit/7774891f161faab183e6c83572a49e37cec8fed8","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/commits/7774891f161faab183e6c83572a49e37cec8fed8/comments","author":{"login":"alepacheco","id":8210939,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyMTA5Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8210939?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alepacheco","html_url":"https://github.com/alepacheco","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alepacheco/followers","following_url":"https: