ur release policy, the API version number therefore needs to be bumped, requiring extensions to be rebuilt.","tree":{"sha":"2dd177c7a696d514339901f6b259446bf68dc2d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/git/trees/2dd177c7a696d514339901f6b259446bf68dc2d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/git/commits/7efb601166e4ee4b4e7aa3d5edb9c7d63007d855","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQBaJXemkdREdU3puaRNP8wvFqZtQUCavMhqwAKCRCRNP8wvFqZ\ntazpAQDpdPOEfYvAmPyn3nggSP98Lms+OD63Wk3maRWdoI63uAD+PcdBSNtePQVq\nShbcvBAdUx1W124DidqMlAX+G37B7AI=\n=NB6C\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 2dd177c7a696d514339901f6b259446bf68dc2d2\nparent e76d6cb9591f3d72a45557cf2e0da972a4b1b6a6\nauthor Matteo Beccati <mbeccati@php.net> 1794307682 +0100\ncommitter Matteo Beccati <mbeccati@php.net> 1794318763 +0100\n\nBump API version numbers\n\nThe php2shell fix introduced an ABI incompatibility in PHP 8.6, but not in older versions, which is why it was missed. Per our release policy, the API version number therefore needs to be bumped, requiring extensions to be rebuilt.\n","verified_at":"2026-11-10T13:53:25Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/commits/7efb601166e4ee4b4e7aa3d5edb9c7d63007d855","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/commit/7efb601166e4ee4b4e7aa3d5edb9c7d63007d855","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/commits/7efb601166e4ee4b4e7aa3d5edb9c7d63007d855/comments","author":{"login":"mbeccati","id":282388,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MjM4OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282388?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbeccati","html_url":"https://github.com/mbeccati","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbeccati/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbeccati/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbeccati/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https: